<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">BBQ-to-Image: Numeric Bounding Box and Qolor Control in Large-Scale Text-to-Image Models</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Eliran Kachlon    Alexander Visheratin    Nimrod Sarid    Tal Hacham     Eyal Gutflaish
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>Saar Huberman    Hezi Zisman    David Ruppin     Ron Mokady    
</span>
